      "ChannelId": "UCiZeuI-7OPs7TmMel6Q5Msw",
      "ChannelTitle": "Kanishk Nishar",
      "Description": "From Severance Hall in Cleveland, Ohio:\nJulia Fischer \u0026 The Cleveland Orchestra (under the baton of Franz Welser-M\u00F6st) perform Johannes Brahms\u0027s Piano Concerto No. 1 in D minor, Op. 15.\n\nPart 2 of the Johannes Brahms concert with Yefim Bronfman, The Cleveland Orchestra \u0026 Franz Welser-M\u00F6st.\n\n#classicalmusic #orchestra #brahms \n\n------- \nSubscribe to wocomoMUSIC: https://goo.gl/ahZRzC\nFollow us on Facebook: http://www.facebook.com/wocomo\n\n------- \nJohannes Brahms - Piano Concerto No. 1 in D minor, Op. 15\n\nChapters\n\u25B7 00:00 Intro\n\u25B7 00:31 I. Maestoso\n\u25B7 22:46 II. Adagio\n\u25B7 35:21 III. Rondo: Allegro non troppo\n\nYefim Bronfman - piano\nThe Cleveland Orchestra\nFranz Welser-M\u00F6st - conductor\n\nDirected by William Cosel\n\nA production of Clasart\n\nExecutive producer: Musical Arts Association Inc. \nin cooperation with WVIZ/PBS ideastream\n\n\u00A9 2015, Clasart / Musical Arts Association Operating the Cleveland Orchestra\n\n------- \n\nHigh-quality music concerts, performances and documentaries \u2013 in areas such as classical, jazz, ballet, modern dance, rock and pop. WocomoMUSIC \u2013 music for grown-ups!\n\nCheck out our other channels to watch high-quality documentaries:\n\u25B7 wocomoCULTURE: https://www.youtube.com/@wocomoCULTURE\n\u25B7 wocomoFRAN\u00C7AIS: https://www.youtube.com/@wocomoFRAN\u00C7AIS\n\u25B7 wocomoHUMANITY: https://www.youtube.com/@wocomoHUMANITY\n\u25B7 wocomoHISTORY: https://www.youtube.com/@wocomoHISTORY\n\nWocomoMUSIC is part of the Wocomo channel network by NIKITA VENTURES. Wocomo - wonderful content in motion.",
